  "description": "Ramen is an open-source (BSD-3) MCP server for teams. Tools, resources and prompts live in a git repo; the\nconsole canary-deploys them to Rust MCP nodes paired with Python 3.14 runtimes across zones behind one load\nbalancer (GKE Gateway or AWS ALB). Workers serve Streamable HTTP and JSON-RPC over gRPC on one port. The console is\nan OAuth 2.1 authorization server with consent per group and zone; roles per group; secrets never displayed; IP\nrules, Redis throttles, audit. Stdio clients use `ramen-mcp-bridge` from PyPI. Runs locally with docker compose.",
